@ code/framework/worldmap.cpp. WorldMapData::load(world, variant) (0x6017BE7C) stores
@ the ids, clears the map and parses the CSVs; CourseSelectMgr calls it once
@ per world and variant at boot. Entry `push {r4, lr}` is position-independent.
@ Ledger F0064.

WorldMap_load:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0017BE7C
    symbol:     ModBase::worldmap::load(worldmap::WorldMapData*, int, int)
    trampoline: ModBase::worldmap::load_orig(worldmap::WorldMapData*, int, int)
